<title>ITALY: CYCLING-TOUR OF SARDINIA THIRD STAGE TIMINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF SARDINIA THIRD STAGE TIMINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ALGHERO, Sardinia 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading timings in</p>
<p>the 156.7 km third stage of the Tour of Sardinia from Oristano</p>
<p>to Alghero on Friday (Italians unless stated):</p>
<p>1. Alexandre Gontchenkov (Russia) 3 hours 55 minutes 43 seconds</p>
<p>2. Claudio Chiappucci</p>
<p> 3. Roberto Petito		    both same time as Gontchenkov</p>
<p> 4. Gabriele Missaglia		10 seconds behind</p>
<p>5. Jan Svorada (Czech Republic)  15 seconds</p>
<p>6. Sandro Giacomelli</p>
<p>7. Vyacheslav Djavanian (Russia)</p>
<p>8. Gabriele Balducci</p>
<p>9. Nicolay Bo Larsen (Denmark)</p>
<p> 10. Luca Mazzanti		     all same time as Svorada</p>
<p>Leading standings:</p>
<p> 1. Petito				12 hours 50 minutes 31 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Chiappucci			   7 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Missaglia			   12 seconds</p>
<p> 4. Alessandro Bertolini	    13 seconds</p>
<p> 5. Svorada			     15 seconds</p>
<p> 6. Armin Meier (Switzerland)     16 seconds</p>
<p> 7. Djavanian			   19 seconds</p>
<p> 8. Germano Pierdomenico	    21 seconds</p>
<p> 9. Balducci			    23 seconds</p>
<p> 10. Massimiliano Mori		same time as Balducci</p>
</text>
